---
// HARNESS HERO — pi.dev's "many agent harnesses, but this one is yours"
// becomes iii's claim: the harness is not the product, the system is, and the
// harness is one worker in it. The right column is a Mux video embed.
---

<section class="hero hz-hero" aria-label="Hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <h1 class="hero-headline hz-hero-headline">
      <span class="line">there are many agent harnesses.</span>
      <span class="line mute">this one is part of your backend.</span>
    </h1>

    <aside class="hz-hero-viz" aria-label="The iii harness building a backend">
      <iframe
        src="https://player.mux.com/rpdfLwndjoEJhD02jpgFQvMoKb3400uEPV00aBVNUTn8QY"
        class="hz-hero-video"
        style="width: 100%; border: none; aspect-ratio: 53/30;"
        allow="accelerometer; gyroscope; autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture;"
        allowfullscreen
      ></iframe>
    </aside>

    <div class="hero-left">
      <p class="hero-sub">most harnesses let you work on your system, but every time you need to make a change you need to rebuild context from scratch because the harness sits on the outside.</p>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        iii is different. with iii, the harness is just one part of the backend. workers, triggers, and functions on <span class="accent">one protocol</span>, so the agent builds on what's already running instead of recreating it every session.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-cta">
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <div class="hero-actions-row">
            <button
              class="pi-install cta-install"
              id="hero-install"
              data-cta-location="hero"
              type="button"
              aria-label="Copy install command"
            >
              <span class="prompt">$</span>
              <span class="cmd">curl -fsSL install.sh | sh</span>
              <span class="copy-ico" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <rect x="5" y="5" width="9" height="9"/>
                  <path d="M3 11 V3 H11"/>
                </svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <a class="cta-get-started ghost" href="https://iii.dev/docs" style="text-decoration:none; display:inline-flex; align-items:center;">read the docs</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pi-trust">
        <a class="cta-github" data-cta-location="hero_trust" href="https://github.com/iii-hq/iii" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github</a>
        <a class="cta-discord" data-cta-location="hero_trust" href="https://discord.gg/iiidev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">discord</a>
        <a href="https://workers.iii.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">worker registry</a>
        <span class="pron">pronounced "three-eye"</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
